  <skos:Concept rdf:about="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/concept/CP-2-0049">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/scheme/cultural-periods"/>
    <skos:notation>CP-2-0049</skos:notation>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">TAHIRID</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Effectively ruled Khorasan from 821 to 873 CE</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="ru">Практически управляли между 821-873 н.э.</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="zh">公元821-863年实际掌握呼罗珊地区。</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="ky">Дээрлик 821-873-жылдардын ортосунда башкарылган.</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="tg">Амалан байни солҳои 821-873 мелодӣ ҳукмронӣ карданд.</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="tk">Aslynda 821-nji ýyldan 873-nji ýyla çenli Horasany dolandyrdy. meselem</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="uz">821-873-yillarda Xurosonni samarali boshqargan</skos:scopeNote>
    <caal:dateRangeLabel>821-873 CE</caal:dateRangeLabel>
    <caal:startYear rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">821</caal:startYear>
    <caal:endYear rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">873</caal:endYear>
    <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/concept/CP-1-0006"/>
  </skos:Concept>
  <skos:Concept rdf:about="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/concept/CP-1-0017">
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/scheme/cultural-periods"/>
    <skos:notation>CP-1-0017</skos:notation>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Sedentary-agricultural cultures of the South-Eastern Aral Sea region</skos:prefLabel>
    <caal:dateRangeLabel>7th-6th centuries of BCE – 7th-8th centuries CE</caal:dateRangeLabel>
    <caal:startYear rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">-700</caal:startYear>
    <caal:endYear rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">800</caal:endYear>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/scheme/cultural-periods"/>
    <skos:narrower>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/concept/CP-2-0074">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/scheme/cultural-periods"/>
        <skos:notation>CP-2-0074</skos:notation>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Chrikirabad culture</skos:prefLabel>
        <caal:dateRangeLabel>4th-2nd centuries BCE</caal:dateRangeLabel>
        <caal:startYear rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">-400</caal:startYear>
        <caal:endYear rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">-101</caal:endYear>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/concept/CP-1-0017"/>
      </skos:Concept>
    </skos:narrower>
    <skos:narrower>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/concept/CP-2-0075">
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/scheme/cultural-periods"/>
        <skos:notation>CP-2-0075</skos:notation>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Zhetyasar culture</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Early Iron Age: 7th-6th – 4th-3rd/2nd centuries BCE), Parthian-Sarmat period: 4th-3rd/2nd centuries BCE – 3rd-4th centuries CE, Sasanian and Early-Medieval (Pre-Islamic) period 3rd-4th – 7th-8th centuries CE</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="ru">ранний железный век: VII-VI – IV-III/II вв .до н.э.), парфяно-сарматское время: IV-III/II вв до н.э. – III-IV вв. н.э., сасанидское и раннесредневековое (доисламское) время III-IV – VII-VIII вв. н.э.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="zh">早期铁器时代：公元前2/3-4-6-7世纪. 帕提亚和萨尔马提亚时期：公元前2-4世纪-公元前3-4世纪. 萨珊和早期中世纪时代（伊斯兰时期之前）：公元前3-4-7-8世纪</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="ky">Эрте темир доору: VII-VI-IV-III/II-кылымдар б.з.ч.), Парфян-сармат доору: IV-III/II-кылымдар б.з.ч. –III-IV кылымдар б.з, Сасанид жана орто кылымдын башында (исламга чейинки) III-IV-VII-VIII кылымдар б.з.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="tg">Асри аввали оҳан: асрҳои VII-VI – IV-III/II пеш аз милод), давраи порту-сармат: асрҳои IV-III/II пеш аз милод – асрҳои III-IV милодӣ, сосониён ва асри миёна (тоисломӣ) – III-IV – VII-VIII-уми милодӣ.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="tk">Irki Demir döwri: b.e.öň VII-VI asyrlardan - IV-III/II asyrlar aralygy), Parfiýa-Sarmat döwri: b.e.öň IV-III/II asyrdan -b.e. III-IV asyrlar aralygy, Sasanylar we Irki orta asyrlar (Yslamdan öňki) döwürler b.e. III-IV asyrdan - VII-VIII asyrlar aralygy</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="uz">Ilk temir davri: miloddan avvalgi VII-VI-IV-III/II asrlar), Parfiya-sarmat davri: miloddan avvalgi IV-III/II asrlar - milodiy III-IV asrlar, Sosoniylar va ilk oʻrta asrlar (islomgacha boʻlgan davr) III-IV – VII-VIII asrlar.</skos:scopeNote>
        <caal:dateRangeLabel>7th c BCE - 8th century CE</caal:dateRangeLabel>
        <caal:startYear rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">-700</caal:startYear>
        <caal:endYear rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">800</caal:endYear>
        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://vocab.uclcaal.org/concept/CP-1-0017"/>
      </skos:Concept>
    </skos:narrower>
  </skos:Concept>
